'''Meowla Meowla''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be unlocked by clearing any of the [[Survive! Mola Mola! Collaboration Event#Survive! Mola Mola!|Survive! Mola Mola!]] stages during the [[Survive! Mola Mola! Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 3.5 Update|Version 3.5]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 175
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Meowla Meowla
|name2 = Catorpedo
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Catorpedo''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Catorpedo is a damage oriented anti-Red meatshield. Unfortunately, in compressing both roles, it sacrifices utility in both aspects leaving mediocre on all fronts. It has a terrible effective HP against Reds at Lv.30 (25,500) which is only slightly higher than a [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]] at equal levels (18,995). Even at Lv.50 it can't hope to tank due to its unusually high knockback count of 4, giving it a durability of only 10,125 at the best of times. Other anti-Red units like [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] easily outperform it, and furthermore once [[Carpenter Cat (Rare Cat)|Carpenter Cat]] is obtained in the late game. This unit can still see some use in the Underground Labyrinth, but that's it.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield & User Rank Dump}}

