==Trivia==
*The line, "Still kinda wishes he became a meteorologist," in Meowla Meowla's description is a reference to the weather forecast program [[wikipedia:ja:ヤン坊マー坊天気予報|''Yanbō Mābō Tenkiyohō'']]. The joke is that the Japanese word for sunfish is ''manbō'', which sounds like a combination of the names of the two mascot characters, Yanbō and Mābō. Thus, if he were to become a ''manbō'', it could mean becoming a sunfish or becoming a third mascot for the program.
**[[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] makes the reference more obvious, as his Japanese name is Nyanbō and his description instead mentions a "weather forecast program started with his brothers."
*Catorpedo is a reference to the [[mariowiki:Bullet Bill|Bullet Bill]] from the [[mariowiki:Mario (series)|Mario]] franchise. "Hates being stepped all over" refers to how [[mariowiki:Mario|Mario]] can defeat Bullet Bills by jumping on them.
*During the [[Survive! Mola Mola! Collaboration Event/2015 Collab|first run of the collab]], this unit was obtained by playing the game "Survive! Mola Mola!" and getting "Sudden Death" when "Cat Mode" had been activated. After that, you would open [[The Battle Cats]] and it would tell you that you had received Meowla Meowla.

